                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a374a7f1-fcc2-3d0b-8768-574d1355e8e6",
                                        "entry_id": "a9bacd8c-68a2-3314-b290-8c4ea5213579",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "present participle and gerund of surprise"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "gerund",
                                            "participle",
                                            "present"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "surprising",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50e01617-321f-3d71-bf16-319a74f51ede",
                                        "entry_id": "a0b4126d-8ec3-3be1-93da-fcefd955b519",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Causing surprise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fb874fa-ec1d-489f-9cbb-fbadbccfe464",
                                                "sense_id": "50e01617-321f-3d71-bf16-319a74f51ede",
                                                "text": "A surprising number of people attended the rally."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c9ab0b3-19a8-4dec-829e-d54d00bd9efb",
                                                "sense_id": "50e01617-321f-3d71-bf16-319a74f51ede",
                                                "text": "With this the second of three games in seven days for Stoke, it was hardly surprising to see nine changes from the side that started against Newcastle in the Premier League on Monday."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7de6a0b1-fc61-4831-8906-4626228fe2a3",
                                                "sense_id": "50e01617-321f-3d71-bf16-319a74f51ede",
                                                "text": "Investors face a quandary. Cash offers a return of virtually zero in many developed countries; government-bond yields may have risen in recent weeks but they are still unattractive. Equities have suffered two big bear markets since 2000 and are wobbling again. It is hardly surprising that pension funds, insurers and endowments are searching for new sources of return."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "surprising",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "10c20ea4-d993-3598-a3bf-287f1444a9fe",
                                        "entry_id": "0d1555ff-f2fc-3fad-ba97-d86bef84d3ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A situation in which somebody is surprised."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae0e97ff-9adf-4af7-b24b-149a398da9a4",
                                                "sense_id": "10c20ea4-d993-3598-a3bf-287f1444a9fe",
                                                "text": "But the comments of most of these novelists are the record of their continual surprisings by the varieties of moral and aesthetic truths."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a78cf95c-2a19-4ce0-ab47-782b7bb7651f",
                        "source_entry_id": "2a459175-8fb7-3b98-92e3-cf23991e1faa",
                        "source_sense_id": "3bac3bd9-2bfe-39da-af1b-8783235b19de",
                        "target_lang_word": "étonnant",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "étonnant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "32cf52da-d0f9-3624-8384-b85938a59e3f",
                                        "entry_id": "4c7907ac-5d47-34c1-877f-839956f10914",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui étonne, qui surprend."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d77c5880-2c0f-48e8-993e-a29b1dd8bfaf",
                                                "sense_id": "32cf52da-d0f9-3624-8384-b85938a59e3f",
                                                "text": "Ce qui m’émerveillait le plus dans les premiers temps, c'était l’étonnante habileté de nos poneys à se tirer d'affaire au milieu d'un chaos de débris volcaniques où un piéton aurait pu difficilement trouver son chemin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68dace42-5bbe-4af2-b4ef-b31e2736f1ab",
                                                "sense_id": "32cf52da-d0f9-3624-8384-b85938a59e3f",
                                                "text": "[…], je vis tragiquement émerger de la nuit une étonnante masure en ruines à un étage, aux persiennes vermoulues et closes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51619c1d-2bf1-49da-b2fd-67a6e062df27",
                                                "sense_id": "32cf52da-d0f9-3624-8384-b85938a59e3f",
                                                "text": "Ce qui est plus grave, c'est que, d’auteur en auteur, les hypothèses sont devenues des certitudes et l'on peut lire dans des ouvrages de vulgarisation les plus étonnantes affirmations, jamais vérifiées, jamais critiquées, prises un jour à la source du possible et entraînées depuis dans le flot de l’indiscutable."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3fc97762-d10d-345b-869b-622a6029ab38",
                                        "entry_id": "4c7907ac-5d47-34c1-877f-839956f10914",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualifie quelqu’un qui est extraordinaire, soit en bien, soit en mal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b7c690f-e2a2-48fc-a8ca-60df7b40973e",
                                                "sense_id": "3fc97762-d10d-345b-869b-622a6029ab38",
                                                "text": "C’est un homme étonnant."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
